== 4.8 Chapter 4 Practice Drill — 40 Questions

40 questions graded in the order the CBT engine is likely to meet them. Allow 44 minutes; the key and a full solution for every question follow.

#mcq(1, [The gas that forms about 78 per cent of dry air is],
  [carbon dioxide],
  [oxygen],
  [nitrogen],
  [argon]
)

#mcq(2, [The layer of the atmosphere in which weather occurs is the],
  [stratosphere],
  [thermosphere],
  [mesosphere],
  [troposphere]
)

#mcq(3, [The ozone layer lies mainly in the],
  [mesosphere],
  [troposphere],
  [thermosphere],
  [stratosphere]
)

#mcq(4, [In the troposphere, temperature generally],
  [rises then falls],
  [rises with height],
  [stays constant],
  [falls with height]
)

#mcq(5, [The normal lapse rate in the troposphere is about],
  [0.5 °C per km],
  [10 °C per km],
  [6.5 °C per km],
  [1 °C per 100 m]
)

#mcq(6, [The instrument used to measure atmospheric pressure is the],
  [rain gauge],
  [anemometer],
  [barometer],
  [hygrometer]
)

